 "manufacturer": "Zhuhai Hongjiacheng Technology",
 "title": "US2AB to US2MB: 2 A surface-mount high-efficiency rectifiers, 50 V to 1000 V, SMB",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev:2.0",
  "pages": 3
 },
 "summary": "A family of seven glass-passivated ultrafast rectifier diodes in DO-214AA (SMB), each rated 2.0 A average and 50 A surge, with reverse voltage grades from 50 V (US2AB) up to 1000 V (US2MB). Recovery time is at most 50 ns up to 400 V and 75 ns for the 600 V to 1000 V grades; junction capacitance is typically 50 pF. Intended jobs are fast rectifying and freewheeling inside switching power converters and inverters. US2MB, the 1000 V grade, drops at most 1.7 V at 2 A.",
